{"id":"00308","root":"uni00308_1","name":{"ja":"井河　アサギ","en":"Igawa Asagi"},"title":{"ja":"【フル装備】","en":"【Full Gear】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【フル装備】 井河　アサギ","en":"【Full Gear】 Igawa Asagi"},"element":"Superhuman","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2020-03-25","limited":true,"characterId":16,"profile":{"ja":"対魔忍を率いる総隊長にして最強の対魔忍と目されている正義のくノ一。カオス・アリーナでの死闘で朧を倒すも恋人・沢木恭介を失う。自身も死闘の中で朧に囚われ、邪悪な魔界医療技術によって肉体を改造されたが、７年前に捕虜にした魔科医・桐生の手によって元の肉体に治療されている。天才的な剣術と体術、人知を超える光速のスピードが武器。また、東京キングダムの死闘では対魔忍の中に潜む真正の魔の力に覚醒し、その能力を格段に向上させて「隼の術」の極意を体得する。政府によって設立された対魔忍養成学校・五車学園の校長を務めている。今回は白い対魔忍衣装をフル装着し任務にあたるのであった。","en":"(Igawa Asagi, she/her) Asagi is the supreme commander of the Taimanin and is regarded as the strongest Kunoichi. In a deadly clash at the Chaos Arena she defeated Oboro but lost her lover Sawaki Kyousuke. She herself was captured by Oboro during the battle and had her body altered with a wicked Demon Realm medical technique, but seven years ago a captive demon doctor named Kiryu restored her to her original form. She wields genius-level swordsmanship, martial arts, and light-speed speed as her weapons. In the fierce battles of Tokyo Kingdom she awakened the true demonic power hidden within the Taimanin, dramatically enhancing her abilities and mastering the ultimate \"Falcon Technique.\" She serves as the principal of Gosha Academy, the government-established Taimanin training school. This time she dons a full white Taimanin outfit to carry out her mission."},"illustrator":"カガミ","voiceActor":"蒼乃むすび","forms":[{"id":"uni00308_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1298,2596],"sp":[180,180],"atk":[234,468],"def":[132,264],"spd":[89,89],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["1","510004"]},{"id":"uni00308_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1796,3592],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[368,736],"def":[164,328],"spd":[89,89],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["1","510004","510005"]},{"id":"uni00308_3","rari